      "readme_excerpt": "# Multi-Agent Job Application System\n\nAutomated job application pipeline using 3 AI agents powered by Ollama (Llama 3.1 8B + Mistral) for free local inference.\n\n## Features\n\n- 🔍 **3-Prong Scraping**: Static sites (BeautifulSoup + requests), JS-rendered (Selenium), Shadow DOM piercing; extracts compensation/salary when present\n- 🤖 **3 AI Agents**: Application analyst (resume + JD), ATS match specialist (score + explanation), cover letter writer (Mistral, natural tone)\n- 📊 **Smart ATS Matching**: Uses skills taxonomy to recognize equivalent tools (PySpark = Big Data, XGBoost = ML, etc.)\n- 📝 **DOCX Cover Letters**: Formatted cover letters matching your style\n- 📈 **Dashboard**: HTML dashboard with application tracking and match scores\n- 🎯 **Single Command**: `python apply.py <job_url>` runs entire pipeline\n\n## Requirements\n\n### 1. Install Ollama\nDownload and install from: https://ollama.com\n\n### 2. Pull Ollama models\n```cmd\nollama pull llama3.1:8b\nollama pull mistral:latest\n```\n- Llama 3.1 8B is used for the Application Analyst and ATS Match Specialist.\n- Mistral is used for the Cover Letter Writer.\n\n### 3. Install Python Dependencies\n```cmd\npip install -r requirements.txt\n```\nOr manua",
