      "readme_excerpt": "# VentureX Transfer Optimizer\n\n**Purpose:** Help you compare **Capital One miles** when planning **US → international** trips, with a focus on **business class** cash fares from live search and how they stack up against **airline transfer partners** (ratios, promos, and optional award observations). I made this using Cursor within a day because I have the VentureX card and want to see if it's possible to fly to Asia in business class.\n\n## What it does\n\n- **Partner directory** — Active partners, transfer ratios, and in-window bonuses from Supabase (`transfer_partners`, `transfer_promotions`).\n- **Flight search** — Live Google Flights–style results via **SerpAPI**, proxied through a **Supabase Edge Function** so your API key stays server-side. Metro airports (e.g. Dallas → DFW/DAL) can be searched together. Not all airports exist within it\n- **Value hints** — For each result, shows transfer-oriented options using `partner_value_ranges` (cpp range + single `transfer_multiplier`) and, when present, **observed** award miles from `award_price_observations`.\n\nAlways confirm transfer rules and promos on [Capital One’s transfer partner page](https://www.capitalone.com/learn-grow/money-manag",
